# Changelog

Notable changes should be documented here.

Using [Maj.Min.Patch] - yyyy-mm-dd to designate change segments

## [0.1.1] - 2026-04-27

### Added
- Added CHANGELOG.md to track changes

### Changed
- Bot version is now configurable with env var: ANCIENT_VERSION
- Bot settings version is now configuration with env var: 
  ANCIENT_SETTINGS_VERSION  
- Support multiple Steam Application IDs in STEAM_APPID, if comma delimited

### Removed
- n/a

### Fixed
- n/a
